(tangent-iip)
*title Tangent plane and IIP
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*trajectory 1 rv start on 1
  *dwn/crs latgd=0 long=0 azm=90
  *tangent latgd=0 long=0 alt=0 azm=90
  *iip iip_beta=550 iip_alt=0
  *initial geodetic long=0 lat=0 psi=90 time=0 alt=200000 vel=12000 gama=-20 wt=500
  *file iip.dat time east north dwnrng crsrng xtp ytp ztp iip_rng iip_azm iip_time iip_long iip_latgd
  *segment 1 ballistic
    *integ dtprnt=2 dt=0.2
    *when time=20 stop
*end
